  {
   "xml_index": 19,
   "xml_name": "L02_019_Sum Of Squares",
   "display_name": "Sum Of Squares",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>Let's combine a loop, a counter, and some arithmetic to compute something a bit more interesting: the sum of squares from 1 to <code>N</code>.</p>\n<p>For example, the sum of squares from 1 to 3 is <code>1*1 + 2*2 + 3*3 = 1 + 4 + 9 = 14</code>.</p>\n<pre>n = int(input())\ntotal = 0\ni = 1\nwhile i <= n:\n    total = total + (i * i)\n    i = i + 1\nprint(total)</pre>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> Read a whole number <code>N</code>. Using a <code>while</code> loop and an accumulator variable, compute and print the sum of the squares of all whole numbers from 1 to <code>N</code> (inclusive).</p>\n<p><b>Example:</b></p>\n<p>Input:</p>\n<pre>3</pre>\n<p>Output:</p>\n<pre>14</pre>",
